# filter redacted: the credentials stay home. A VPN configuration IS the
# secret (private key, preshared key, user/password), so the configurations
# are dropped as a whole; the description (categories, links, sessions, the
# key record, the receipts) travels complete.
# <glob> <reason>
*/wireguard/*.conf secret
*/openvpn/*.ovpn secret
*/.tmp/* operational
*/.log/* operational
